---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms & Disclaimers - The Neural Chef" description="Legal terms, conditions, and AI recipe generation disclaimers.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-slate-800 py-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6">
      Terms & Disclaimers
    </h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p class="text-slate-650 italic">
        Last updated: August 30, 2026
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. AI-Generated Content</h2>
        <p>
          All recipes, flavor profiles, instructions, and cooking metrics published on <strong>The Neural Chef</strong> are generated by artificial intelligence models (such as LLMs). These models simulate culinary ideas based on patterns in training data and do not possess human senses of taste, smell, or chemical compatibility.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Culinary Discretion & Safety Warning</h2>
        <p>
          Because these recipes are mathematically and statistically estimated by software:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
          <li><strong>Baking & Cooking Temperatures:</strong> Oven temperatures, stovetop heat levels, and cooking durations are estimates. Always verify that meats, eggs, and other perishables reach safe internal temperatures using a food thermometer.</li>
          <li><strong>Allergies & Dietary Restrictions:</strong> The AI may occasionally suggest ingredients or combinations that might conflict with specific dietary needs. You are responsible for inspecting ingredients for allergens, toxins, or raw food safety issues.</li>
          <li><strong>Liquid & Ratios:</strong> Volumetric ratios (e.g. flour to water, baking soda, spices) are compiled algorithms. Failure of texture, rise, or taste may occur.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          The owner of <strong>The Neural Chef</strong> is not responsible or liable for any adverse reactions, injuries, food poisoning, kitchen fires, appliance damage, or emotional distress resulting from attempting recipes generated on this site. You cook at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Educational & Experimental Purpose</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated as an autonomous algorithmic cooking experiment. It is not intended to provide professional nutritional, medical, or chemical advice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Amazon Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>The Neural Chef</strong> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for websites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and affiliated websites (including Amazon.co.uk, Amazon.de, Amazon.fr, etc.). 
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          When you click on links to various products on this website and make a purchase, this can result in this site earning a small advertising commission. This commission comes at no extra cost to you. Affiliate links are only used for kitchen gear, gadgets, and tools that we recommend for bringing our digital recipes to life.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
